  <p id="c-liangshu-027-five-appraisals:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">陳吏部尚書<persName id="c-liangshu-027-five-appraisals:p001:m0005" ref="evj_3wb_3l3_****A*AAA">姚察</persName>曰：<persName id="c-liangshu-027-five-appraisals:p001:m0009" ref="war_qdw_fs5">陸倕</persName>博涉文理，<persName id="c-liangshu-027-five-appraisals:p001:m0016" ref="4mr_j4p_k5h">到洽</persName>匪躬貞勁，<persName id="c-liangshu-027-five-appraisals:p001:m0023" ref="nbb_y6s_bfz_AAA">明山賓</persName>儒雅篤實，<persName id="c-liangshu-027-five-appraisals:p001:m0031" ref="ceq_pnr_q0e_A">殷鈞</persName>靜素恬和，<persName id="c-liangshu-027-five-appraisals:p001:m0038" ref="d5x_77n_qxq_A">陸襄</persName>淳深孝性，雖任遇有異，皆列於名臣矣。</p>
